  "evidence": [
    "Pinned DesignWin::init43C270 writes six RECTs at AAC..AFC;43C58E sets top-word pointer atAB0,43C594..5A4 loads edges,43C5AF calls Spot::add,43C5B5 advances16 and43C5B8 compares six. Replace artificial local pointer table with actual array.",
    "Pinned43C879 seeds five-row count;43C908 selects this+B8C,43C918..920 writes RECT fields,43C931 advances16,43C93E loops. Existing B8C/B9C/BAC/BBC/BCC members form one five-row producer/consumer run, distinct from other geometry.",
    "Consumers include six DesignWin draw bodies, button geometry/copies/UnionRect, and TutWin::tour7. Existing tutorial labels ground component and lower-action roles; descriptive enums do not claim original debug names. Update all five affected test fixtures while retaining live prototype reload and tutorial cancellation/identity controls.",
    "Keep original coordinate ordering, unchecked paths and live call reads. Source ownership and typed array interpretation require native count/extent/offset verification; fresh baseline/candidate matching and full build/link plus independent review precede integration. No automatic/full-game acceptance inferred."
  ],
  "intent": "Recover six component panel rectangles and five lower action rectangles as real arrays, migrating the entire drawing/button/tutorial consumer closure while preserving original geometry, calls, callbacks and historical claims.",
